# Context loading

Parent docs live one level up. Load only what the current task needs. Do not dump them into every chat.

| File | Load when |
|------|-----------|
| `../INDEX.md` | You need the map of what exists |
| `../company.md` | Baseline company / acquisition / enterprise GTM |
| `../product.md` | Product decisions, PRDs, integration architecture |
| `../goals.md` | Prioritization for Jim's modules (Assure, Operate, Guard, Service) |
| `../personas.md` | User-facing work, discovery, roadmap |

Never auto-load `../competitors.md` or `../buyer-personas.md`. Those are reference — open only for competitive or positioning work.

`../INDEX.md` points at `research_backlog.md`, which is missing. Do not invent that file.

These docs were last updated May 2026. Treat them as background, not current strategy. If a task depends on Now/Next/Later, pressure-test with Jim before treating a May claim as gospel.

Do not recommend SMB / self-serve / sub-50-location features. Enterprise GTM, 50+ locations.

Do not treat company-level goals (unified login, AI exception reporting, ARR) as Jim's backlog. His Now is in `../goals.md`: tech debt, Assure GTM support, Org Hierarchy/RBAC.
